      }
    ],
    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "Accuracy results are a preliminary experiment. The paper cites Kaplan et al. only as background. The two sizes in each family may differ in training data and recipe, and GPT-OSS is MoE, so 'scale' is confounded. R16's GPT-OSS-20B physics GPQA of 91.63 is much higher than its chemistry GPQA of 43.66; this is as printed in Table 6."
  },
